<note><title>test</title><content><![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd"><en-note><div><u>Steps</u></div><div><br /></div><ol start="1"><li><div>Draft the proposal. I did this right after we concluded our Skype call 8/24/17. </div></li><li><div>Robin to flesh it out with more detail. We finish it. </div></li><li><div>Circulate to peer colleagues.</div></li></ol><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><u>Target colleagues and other stakeholders</u></div><div>Alex at the funding body. Sam knows them well. </div><div>Someone at the association</div><div>someone named Chris - a diss reader of Robin</div><div>Jordan at the university</div><div>The society are the obvious people. Pat is on its executive. Robin and Pat wrote the red scraper [for the society]. </div><div>An international thing would be more powerful. </div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><div><br /></div></en-note>      ]]></content><created>20170825T013331Z</created><updated>20210312T034853Z</updated><note-attributes><author>A. Author</author><source>desktop.win</source><source-application>evernote.win32</source-application><reminder-order>0</reminder-order></note-attributes></note>
</en-export>
